    family's own overflow decomposition names the word. *)
Lemma gxi_1RB0LC_1LC0RA_1LD0LD_0RB1LC : forall j, Cin (fill (pow2 j)) = cden [] [] j BE0_1RB0LC_1LC0RA_1LD0LD_0RB1LC.
