  | StA, S0 => mk S1 DR StB | StA, S1 => mk S0 DL StC
  | StB, S0 => mk S1 DL StC | StB, S1 => mk S0 DR StA
  | StC, S0 => mk S1 DL StD | StC, S1 => mk S1 DL StB
  | StD, S0 => mk S0 DR StB | StD, S1 => mk S0 DL StD end.

(** Its mirror 1LB0RC_1RC0LA_1RD1RB_0LB0RD: the same counter grown leftward.  Every
