  - intros t Ht p _. apply fire_1RB0LC_1LC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB0LD. exact Ht.
Qed.

Theorem nqhtr_1RB0LC_1LC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB0LD : NeverQuasiHaltsTr tm_1RB0LC_1LC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB0LD.
