(** * LAPT_1RB0LC_1LC1RA_0RA1LD_1RC1LC: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LC_1LC1RA_0RA1LD_1RC1LC, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
