  unfold Cc_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA0LC, cden, Z0_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA0LC, Z1_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA0LC; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
