Module LAPT_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA1LA.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA1LA: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_0RA1LA, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

